    Lilita One by Juan Montoreano, Fredoka by Milena Brand\xE3o. SIL Open Font License.\n<color=#C24E18>Music</color> 
    \"Etirwer\" by Kistol, \"Bossa Shop Theme\" by SpringySpringo (OpenGameArt).
    CC0.\n<color=#C24E18>Sound effects</color>  Casual Game Sounds by Dustyroom.
    CC0.\n\nThank you for visiting Grandma!"
